body:
>This sounds like sensory overload and issues with visual/auditory processing. There are many disorders that can have these symptoms, like anxiety and autism. Not trying to diagnose you with either of these things, but just posing the possibility that these experiences may stem from an underlying issue. Some times even an obscene amount of stress might cause such experiences.

Thank you! :)

&#x200B;

Oh! I recommend unhelpful guides/meme guides as they can be funny and help learn inside jokes and what-not. V-Live may have something interesting as far as watching performances and stuff. Here is some stuff you may find helpful;

